{"id":"5ec4763cfc7da9d5","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-ordinal-addition.md","title":"序数加法","display":"df-ordinal-addition — 序数加法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-ordinal-addition","aliases":["18-df-ordinal-addition","18-df-015"],"display":"df-ordinal-addition — 序数加法","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]","[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"3.3.1–3.3.2; 3.2.7","source_printed_pages":"28–29;23–24","source_pdf_pages":"38–39;33–34","source_correspondence":"equivalent-recursive-presentation","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-ordinal-addition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-ordinal-addition</span><span>18-df-015</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-addition — 序数加法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.3.1–3.3.2; 3.2.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"28–29;23–24"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"38–39;33–34"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"equivalent-recursive-presentation"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span>；序数比较与后继见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 由序数超限递归引入，为可定义类函数，输入/输出都是集合序数；类函数不是集合函数。递归背景为原书 Theorem 3.2.7。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha+0&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\\\\n\\alpha+\\operatorname{succ}(\\beta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha+\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha+\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}(\\alpha+\\xi),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\\alpha+\\beta&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\alpha+1&amp;=\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha+0&amp;\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\\\\n\\alpha+\\operatorname{succ}(\\beta)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha+\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha+\\lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}(\\alpha+\\xi),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\\alpha+\\beta&amp;\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\alpha+1&amp;=\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 3.3.1 先用枚举类函数定义加法；Observation 3.3.2 给出本节点采用的等价递归方程。由 Theorem 3.2.7 存在唯一，再对第二参数归纳得值为序数。这是等价递归呈示，不把全体序数视作集合函数定义域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}$；序数比较与后继见 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]、[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}$；序数比较与后继见 [[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]、[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha+0&\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\\\\n\\alpha+\\operatorname{succ}(\\beta)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha+\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha+\\lambda&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}(\\alpha+\\xi),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\quad\\alpha+\\beta&\\in\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\alpha+1&=\\operatorname{succ}(\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1648,"backlinks":[{"id":"cb8e0157911ac3fc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$n<\\omega$，$\\vec\\beta:n\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\vec k:n\\to\\omega$；有限序数和按索引递增、左结合，空和为 0。序数运算见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-ordinal-addition]]"},{"id":"c6b98d99fde7dfdc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}$；加法见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]，后继与极限类见 [[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"31288cfe398953a3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$0,1,2,\\omega$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的冯诺伊曼序数；$+,\\cdot$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]] 的运算。"},{"id":"58edb65d7d47e0c1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；序数加、乘、幂见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]，$\\varphi$ 与 $\\Gamma_0$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。"},{"id":"4a7ec48377bb048a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$0,1,2,\\omega$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal]] 的冯诺伊曼序数；$+,\\cdot$ 为 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]] 的运算。"},{"id":"1d831a9b19228b41","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；序数加、乘、幂见 [[18-df-ordinal-addition]]、[[18-df-ordinal-multiplication]]、[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]，$\\varphi$ 与 $\\Gamma_0$ 见 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]、[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。"},{"id"